62:["$","p",null,{"children":["Nepal Standard Time is ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"UTC+05:45"}],", one of the few non-hourly timezones in the world. It is calculated based on the meridian passing through the summit of ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Mount Gauri Shankar"}]," at longitude ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"86°15' East"}],". When performing date calculations near midnight, ensure that your application accounts for the +05:45 offset to avoid single-day boundary shifts."]}]
